  "translations": {
    "Plan Jasper around one walkable town base and separate driving days for Maligne Valley, the southbound falls and the 232 km Icefields Parkway to Lake Louise. Compare four or five nights, town lodging with campground transport, and a Lake Louise overnight for a through trip. The local campground shuttle is seasonal and does not serve Maligne Lake or Highway 93. Check open and closed facilities, road status, weather, fuel and daylight before setting out; keep a town day as the fallback.": "以步行友善的賈斯珀鎮為基地，將瑪琳谷、南行瀑布和前往路易斯湖的232公里冰原大道分日安排。比較四或五晚住宿、鎮上住處與營地交通，並考慮穿越行程在路易斯湖過夜。營地接駁為季節性服務，不前往瑪琳湖或93號公路。出發前查詢開放設施、路況、天氣、燃油和日照；保留鎮上行程作為備案。",
