    "road conditions": "道路狀況",
    "Walk Jasper’s central blocks and a signed Athabasca River path for an easy arrival loop, then set aside a separate road day for Maligne Valley. Maligne Lake and Maligne Canyon have different access and closure status. A confirmed vehicle or named operator is needed for the valley; the seasonal campground shuttle does not go there. Check Maligne Road, Parks Canada notices, daylight and the current cruise calendar before booking. The 2026 cruise season ended 11 October, weather dependent.": "步行賈斯珀中心街區與有標示的阿薩巴斯卡河步道，安排輕鬆的抵達日環線；另留一天開車前往瑪琳谷。瑪琳湖和瑪琳峽谷的交通與封閉狀態不同。前往山谷需要確認可用的車輛或具名業者；季節性營地接駁不會到達。預訂前查瑪琳路、公園管理局公告、日照和最新遊船行事曆。2026年遊船季於10月11日結束，並受天候影響。",
