    "Jasper shuttle": "賈斯珀接駁車",
    "Treat Highway 93 as a full-day 232 km road between Jasper and Lake Louise, not a quick transfer. Plan fuel, water, food, offline directions, a few stops and a fixed daylight endpoint. Athabasca Falls is 30 km south of Jasper, Sunwapta Falls 54 km and the Columbia Icefield Centre 104 km. Check Parks Canada, Alberta 511, seasonal services, snow and operator dates. The 2026 glacier products ended by 12 October; availability and departures are not promised.": "將93號公路當成賈斯珀與路易斯湖間232公里的全天景觀路線，而非快速轉乘。規劃燃油、飲水、食物、離線導航、少量停靠點和日光下的固定終點。阿薩巴斯卡瀑布距賈斯珀以南30公里，森瓦普塔瀑布54公里，哥倫比亞冰原中心104公里。出發前查公園管理局、Alberta 511、季節服務、降雪與業者日期。2026年冰河遊程於10月12日前結束；供應和班次未作保證。",
